levels 60-60
zone Felwood
keywords Rhok'delar, Lok'delar, Ancient Sinew Wrapped Lamina, Stave of the Ancients, A Proper String, Vartrus the Ancient, Ancient Petrified Leaf, Molten Core, Onyxia, Azuregos, epic bow, class quest
